### Generate Standard Bank Statement (Local Server - 3 Months)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/generateStandardBankStatement
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "10737272002",
  "months": 3
}

###

### Generate Standard Bank Statement (Local Server - 1 Month)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/generateStandardBankStatement
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "10737272002",
  "months": 1
}

###

### Send Standard Bank Proof of Payment (POP) Email
POST http://localhost:1337/api/send-standard-bank-pop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationValue": "mickytroxxy@gmail.com",
  "senderName": "John Doe",
  "amount": "1500.00",
  "accountNumber": "10737272002",
  "paymentReference": "REF123456",
  "bankName": "Standard Bank",
  "isImmediate": true,
  "attachmentPath": "./files/10737272002/bankstatement.pdf"
}

###

### Send Capitec App Proof of Payment (POP)
POST http://localhost:1337/api/send-capitec-pop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "1500.00",
  "date": 1727520000000,
  "beneficiary": "Jane Smith",
  "accountNumber": "10737272002",
  "bankName": "Capitec",
  "branch": "470010",
  "paymentType": "Immediate payment",
  "paymentReference": "REF987654",
  "notificationNumber": "123456",
  "senderName": "John Doe",
  "title": "Mr",
  "notificationType": "EMAIL",
  "notificationValue": "mickytroxxy@gmail.com",
  "isImmediate": true
}

